request.description:
Send a test notification to yourself (Development only - not available in production).

**Optional Fields:**
- `type` - Notification type (default: SYSTEM)
- `title` - Notification title (default: "Test Notification")
- `message` - Notification message
- `priority` - Priority level (default: MEDIUM)

**Response:**
```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "message": "Test notification sent",
  "data": {
    "notification": {...}
  }
}
```
